      "body": "JellyTrack\nMy Account\nDashboard\nRecently Added\nLibrary\nUsers\nLog health\nLogs\nSettings\nLANGUAGE\nEnglish\nTHEME\nDark\nSign Out\nJellyTrack v0.0.0\nJellyfin\nSSO\nSecurity\nMedia Settings\nTask Scheduler\nData Backups\nNotifications\nMedia Settings\nManage resolution thresholds and content display preferences.\nNote\nA full synchronization is required to apply these changes.\nLibraries excluded from statistics\n\nLibraries disabled below will be excluded from all dashboard statistics.\n\nToggle each library per server. Two libraries with the same name on different servers are handled separately.\n\nAudit principal\nhttp://127.0.0.1:9\nCinéma\nActive\nLivres\nActive\nMusique\nActive\nSéries\nActive\nAudit secondaire\nhttp://localhost:9\nCinéma\nActive\nLivres\nActive\nMusique\nActive\nSéries\nActive\nLibrary badge display\n\nShow or hide resolution, series quality and bitrate badges in the Library tab.\n\nShow media badges\n\nDisable this option to visually lighten media cards.\n\nRules per Library\n\nManage abandonment and completion thresholds per library. You can disable completion tracking for some libraries (e.g. Music).\n\nAdjust thresholds to define when playback is considered skipped, abandoned, partial, or completed for each library type.\n\nDefault rule (other libraries)\n\nActive\n\nAbandoned\n\nPartial\n\nCompleted\n\nMovies\n\nActive\n\nAbandoned\n\nPartial\n\nCompleted\n\nTV Shows\n\nActive\n\nAbandoned\n\nPartial\n\nCompleted\n\nMusic\n\nActive\n\nAbandoned\n\nPartial\n\nCompleted\n\nBooks\n\nActive\n\nAbandoned\n\nPartial\n\nCompleted\n\nHome Videos\n\nActive\n\nAbandoned\n\nPartial\n\nCompleted\n\nResolution Thresholds\n\nConfigure how JellyTrack categorizes video quality. If a file exceeds either the width OR height of a threshold, it is promoted to the higher category.\n\nSD / 480p Threshold (Max)\n480P\nMax Width (px)\nMax Height (px)\n720p HD Threshold (Max)\n720P\nMax Width (px)\nMax Height (px)\n1080p FHD Threshold (Max)\n1080P\nMax Width (px)\nMax Height (px)\n4K UHD Threshold (Max)\n4K\nMax Width (px)\nMax Height (px)\nCancel\nSave Settings",
      "rendered": true
    },
