      "body": "JellyTrack\nMy Account\nDashboard\nRecently Added\nLibrary\nUsers\nLog health\nLogs\nSettings\nLANGUAGE\nEnglish\nTHEME\nDark\nSign Out\nJellyTrack v0.0.0\nJellyfin\nSSO\nSecurity\nMedia Settings\nTask Scheduler\nData Backups\nNotifications\nTask Scheduler\nManage automatic synchronization and backup tasks.\nRecent Sync\n\nSynchronize only recently added/modified items.\n\nEvery 6h\nRun\nFull Sync\n\nPerforms a full synchronization of all media metadata. This may take some time.\n\nEvery 48h\nRun\nIntegrity Check\n\nDetects and closes orphaned playback sessions (network disconnects or client crashes).\n\nEvery 6h\nRun\nBackup Task\n\nAutomatic nightly backup task.\n\nEvery 24h\nRun\nPlayback History Consolidation\n\nDetects and merges fragmented playback sessions caused by pauses, buffers or disconnects.\n\nDaily at 03:45 UTC\nRun\nSave Schedules\nSchedule each task automatically with an hourly interval. Recommended example: Recent sync 6h, full sync 48h, backup 24h.\nRecent Sync\nAutomatic interval in hours (1-24)\nh\nFull Sync\nAutomatic interval in hours (24-168, multiple of 24)\nh\nIntegrity Check\nAutomatic interval in hours (1-168)\nh\nBackup Task\nAutomatic interval in hours (1-168)\nh\nSystem Log Retention\nDuration before automated log file and audit history rotation and deletion.\n7 days\n14 days\n30 days\n60 days\n90 days\n180 days\n365 days\nKeep indefinitely\nSave Schedules\nAvailability period for the current year\nDefines when the current year's Wrapped (2025+) becomes accessible. Previous years always remain accessible.\nEnable automatic availability period\n\nIf enabled, the Wrapped feature will only be accessible between the defined dates.\n\nWrapped General Visibility\n\nShow or hide the Wrapped item in the sidebar and navigation.\n\nSave Settings",
      "rendered": true
    },
